# Exercises Search against the compose stack (`make up`), over the seed's Products. Search needs no
# token. Run the requests top to bottom in the IntelliJ HTTP client; the Staff token request stores
# a token for the Price change at the end, made through Catalog.

@search = http://localhost:8089
@catalog = http://localhost:8081
@keycloak = http://localhost:8180/realms/ecomm/protocol/openid-connect/token

### Everything, newest first, with every Category's count
GET {{search}}/search

### Text: any of the words, in the name, the description or the attribute values
GET {{search}}/search?q=pixel

### Best match first, or by Price
GET {{search}}/search?q=apple&sort=price-desc

### A Category, which brings its attributes' facets
GET {{search}}/search?category=phones

### An axis value: Products with any Variant in 256 GB. The storage facet still counts 128 GB.
GET {{search}}/search?category=phones&attr.storage=256 GB

### Several values of one attribute match any of them; different attributes must all match
GET {{search}}/search?category=phones&attr.storage=128 GB&attr.storage=256 GB&attr.brand=Apple

### A NUMBER attribute's range, both ends included; leave one out to open it (no seed Category has one)
GET {{search}}/search?category=phones&range.weight=..200

### Any Variant's Price between €500.00 and €900.00, in Stock
GET {{search}}/search?currency=EUR&price=50000..90000&inStock=true

### The second page of five
GET {{search}}/search?sort=price-asc&page=1&size=5

### 400: a price needs its currency
GET {{search}}/search?price=50000..90000

### 400: an unknown sort
GET {{search}}/search?sort=cheapest

### Staff token: for changing a Price through Catalog
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=dev-cli&username=staff@ecomm.local&password=staff

> {% client.global.set("staffToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Change the JBL Flip 6's Price through Catalog, from €129.00 to €119.00
PUT {{catalog}}/products/AUD-JBL-FLIP-6
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku": "AUD-JBL-FLIP-6", "name": "JBL Flip 6", "category": "audio",
 "attributes": {"brand": "JBL", "type": "Portable speaker", "wireless": "true", "waterproof": "IP67"},
 "images": ["/images/products/aud-jbl-flip-6/front.svg"],
 "variants": [{"id": "AUD-JBL-FLIP-6", "axisValues": {}, "price": {"amountMinor": 11900, "currency": "EUR"}}]}

### Within a second or two, Search shows the new Price
GET {{search}}/search?q=flip
